{"parentUuid": null, "isSidechain": false, "promptId": "76d5909d-87e2-44dd-b3b7-d564ac7156fb", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "~300 loops in the packs have no bpm in the name so the renamer leaves it off. add beat_tools/bpm.py that estimates bpm with librosa and the renamer can call it for files tagged loop (or longer than 2s with no bpm). round to int, and fold to the 70-180 range"}, "uuid": "dd7c8a3a-e0e0-400a-8a4b-4f381c85c24a", "timestamp": "2026-09-29T02:41:10.406Z", "permissionMode": "default", "userType": "external", "entrypoint": "cli", "cwd": "/Users/divadbaroon/Projects/beat-tools", "sessionId": "2b9fa083-4e24-4b79-b25b-928a8c238f36", "version": "2.1.278", "gitBranch": "main"}
{"parentUuid": "dd7c8a3a-e0e0-400a-8a4b-4f381c85c24a", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5", "id": "msg_015KCJJq3omAdxYs9XkdEaKx", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01GbQRcX193puqINBmpbcV1m", "name": "Write", "input": {"file_path": "/Users/divadbaroon/Projects/beat-tools/beat_tools/bpm.py", "content": "\"\"\"Tempo estimate for loops (librosa beat tracker), folded into 70-180 BPM.\"\"\"\nimport librosa\n\n\ndef fold(bpm, lo=70, hi=180):\n    while bpm < lo:\n        bpm *= 2\n    while bpm > hi:\n        bpm /= 2\n    return bpm\n\n\ndef estimate(path, sr=22050):\n    y, sr = librosa.load(path, sr=sr, mono=True)\n    if len(y) < 2 * sr:\n        return None  # one-shots: no tempo\n    onset = librosa.onset.onset_strength(y=y, sr=sr)\n    tempo = librosa.feature.tempo(onset_envelope=onset, sr=sr, aggregate=None)\n    return int(round(fold(float(tempo.mean()))))\n"}}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1174, "cache_read_input_tokens": 20420, "output_tokens": 186, "service_tier": "standard"}}, "requestId": "req_011CS7caclZv1QURMC5BW2nq", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "c04314e4-4db8-426c-aeb7-628a89f006a8", "timestamp": "2026-09-29T02:41:17.201Z", "userType": "external", "entrypoint": "cli", "cwd": "/Users/divadbaroon/Projects/beat-tools", "sessionId": "2b9fa083-4e24-4b79-b25b-928a8c238f36", "version": "2.1.278", "gitBranch": "main"}
